Hello, the short answer to your question is no it does not, 10 minutes vig PA + 20 minutes moderate PA would still be 30 minutes. Time in MVPA is the sum time spent above the moderate and vigorous thresholds specified in your script (arguments "threshold.mod" and "threshold.vig" for part 5 analyses, or in "mvpathreshold" if just running up to part 2) . You do get these two separate time values so if you wanted to double the value of vigorous intensity for some reason you could do it post-hoc.

